Subject: Small patch to allow for the TCC.EXE (and TCCLIB.DLL) to reside in a (directory under) a "bin/" directory at the same level where the "include/" and "lib/" directories are. This allows one to set the PATH to the (proper) binaries directory and TCC will then "find" itself there.  Tested under Windows 7, Windows 8.1 (ARM) and Windows 10+11, but should also be workable for Linux and macOS.

